{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00107",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 6.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Doctor, I've checked them in and done the preliminary measurements, I'll hand them over when you ask."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.95,
      "end_seconds": 12.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.24,
      "end_seconds": 18.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.13,
      "end_seconds": 28.61,
      "duration_seconds": 8.48,
      "text": "Yeah, um, it's constant tiredness. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.21,
      "end_seconds": 36.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.28,
      "end_seconds": 43.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "I've, I've had it for three weeks. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.0,
      "end_seconds": 48.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "What about hair falling out, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.35,
      "end_seconds": 57.57,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had that since last weekend. Right, I was feeling cold at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.12,
      "end_seconds": 62.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.66,
      "end_seconds": 77.36,
      "duration_seconds": 13.7,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.6,
      "end_seconds": 84.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever, blood in the stool or shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.29,
      "end_seconds": 93.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "Uh, um, no fever, blood in the stool or shortness of breath, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.14,
      "end_seconds": 96.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Has there been any low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.83,
      "end_seconds": 98.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "No. No low mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.16,
      "end_seconds": 102.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.22,
      "end_seconds": 104.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.1,
      "end_seconds": 110.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.72,
      "end_seconds": 111.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.71,
      "end_seconds": 127.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.6,
      "end_seconds": 130.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "No operations, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.48,
      "end_seconds": 134.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.1,
      "end_seconds": 152.99,
      "duration_seconds": 17.89,
      "text": "Um, uh, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.01,
      "end_seconds": 157.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Okay, anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.04,
      "end_seconds": 163.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "My sister has epilepsy. So, my grandmother had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.84,
      "end_seconds": 170.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.38,
      "end_seconds": 179.52,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "I've, I've got diabetes. Arthritis in my knees, for five years. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.86,
      "end_seconds": 187.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Mm. Okay, arthritis in my knees, that's already on your record. Good to know. Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.95,
      "end_seconds": 191.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.93,
      "end_seconds": 195.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.49,
      "end_seconds": 197.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.71,
      "end_seconds": 209.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.92,
      "end_seconds": 213.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Glimepiride, 2 milligrams, before breakfast for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 214.02,
      "end_seconds": 218.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 4 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.1,
      "end_seconds": 221.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.51,
      "end_seconds": 231.96,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "Right, no, I left it at home. Yeah, I take paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed for the knee pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.48,
      "end_seconds": 236.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.04,
      "end_seconds": 238.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.49,
      "end_seconds": 242.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.15,
      "end_seconds": 251.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Peanuts. I come out in... well, my lips swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 252.38,
      "end_seconds": 260.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.17,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pulse is 81 beats a minute, pressure 128 over 81, oxygen saturation is 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.59,
      "end_seconds": 262.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.45,
      "end_seconds": 268.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.68,
      "end_seconds": 272.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts as I press."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.24,
      "end_seconds": 291.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Your thyroid isn't enlarged, I can't feel any lumps in your neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.88,
      "end_seconds": 294.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.69,
      "end_seconds": 310.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "You look a little pale in the eyelids."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.96,
      "end_seconds": 325.69,
      "duration_seconds": 11.73,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.52,
      "end_seconds": 332.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.34,
      "end_seconds": 354.14,
      "duration_seconds": 20.8,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with persistent tiredness, possibly from low iron. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I'd also keep thyroid disease in mind. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had constant tiredness for three weeks, and no blood in the stool or shortness of breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.42,
      "end_seconds": 357.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.25,
      "end_seconds": 366.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a ferritin level for suspected low iron. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.65,
      "end_seconds": 367.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.33,
      "end_seconds": 379.31,
      "duration_seconds": 10.98,
      "text": "We should do a thyroid test for fatigue. I'm going to order a vitamin B12 level, for fatigue. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.97,
      "end_seconds": 383.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Okay, uh, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.2,
      "end_seconds": 407.92,
      "duration_seconds": 22.72,
      "text": "Let's use vitamin D, 60000 units, once a week, for eight weeks. You take it by mouth. It's for low energy. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Try to keep a regular sleep time and get some daylight in the morning. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 409.51,
      "end_seconds": 423.85,
      "duration_seconds": 14.34,
      "text": "Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 425.28,
      "end_seconds": 426.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 427.84,
      "end_seconds": 442.99,
      "duration_seconds": 15.15,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently. I'd like to see you again after the results are back. I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 444.55,
      "end_seconds": 449.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 450.86,
      "end_seconds": 456.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "So, yes, exactly right. Alright, I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 456.99,
      "end_seconds": 459.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    }
  ]
}